---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import styles from '../styles/legal.module.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | WitrQuran"
  description="This Cookie Policy explains how WitrQuran uses cookies and similar browser storage technologies."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class={styles.pageContainer}>
    <nav class={styles.breadcrumb} aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>Cookie Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <header class={styles.header}>
      <h1 class={styles.title}>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class={styles.lastUpdated}>Last Updated: September 27, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class={styles.content}>
      <p>WitrQuran is designed to provide a simple and uninterrupted Quran listening experience without advertising tracking or unnecessary data collection.</p>

      <p>This Cookie Policy explains how WitrQuran uses cookies and similar browser storage technologies.</p>

      <h2>1. What Are Cookies</h2>

      <p>Cookies are small pieces of information that websites may store in your browser to remember information or provide certain functionality.</p>

      <p>Similar technologies such as browser local storage can also store information directly on your device.</p>

      <h2>2. How WitrQuran Uses Browser Storage</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran does not use cookies for advertising analytics behavioral tracking or cross-site tracking.</p>

      <p>We use browser storage only when necessary to provide a useful listening experience.</p>

      <h3>Listening Position</h3>

      <p>WitrQuran may save your current listening position in your browser so that when you return you can continue listening from approximately where you stopped.</p>

      <p>This information:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Is stored locally on your device</li>
        <li>Is not stored on WitrQuran servers</li>
        <li>Is not used to identify you</li>
        <li>Is not used for advertising</li>
        <li>Is not used for analytics</li>
        <li>Is not shared with advertisers</li>
        <li>Is retained for approximately six months</li>
      </ul>

      <p>The purpose is simply to remember where you stopped listening.</p>

      <h2>3. No Tracking Cookies</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran does not use cookies or similar technologies for:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Advertising</li>
        <li>Personalized advertising</li>
        <li>Behavioral profiling</li>
        <li>Cross-site tracking</li>
        <li>Analytics</li>
        <li>Marketing</li>
        <li>Selling or sharing user behavior data</li>
      </ul>

      <p>We do not use Google Analytics, Microsoft Clarity, Meta Pixel, or similar tracking systems.</p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>

      <p>WitrQuran uses technical infrastructure such as Cloudflare and Vercel to deliver and operate the website.</p>

      <p>These infrastructure providers may use their own technically necessary technologies as part of providing their services.</p>

      <p>Such technologies are controlled by the respective providers and are not used by WitrQuran for advertising or behavioral profiling.</p>

      <h2>5. Managing Local Storage</h2>

      <p>You can remove locally stored WitrQuran data through your browser settings.</p>

      <p>Clearing your browser's site data may remove your saved listening position.</p>

      <p>If you clear this information, WitrQuran may no longer remember where you previously stopped listening.</p>

      <h2>6. Changes to This Cookie Policy</h2>

      <p>We may update this Cookie Policy if the way WitrQuran uses cookies or similar technologies changes.</p>

      <p>When changes are made, we will update the <strong>Last Updated</strong> date at the beginning of this page.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>

      <p>If you have questions about this Cookie Policy, contact:</p>

      <p><strong>Md Faruk Abdulla</strong></p>

      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:witrfaruk@proton.me">witrfaruk@proton.me</a></p>

      <p><a href="https://github.com/witrfaruk?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></p>

      <p>WitrQuran is built to keep Quran listening simple, private, and free from unnecessary tracking.</p>

      <p><strong>The Quran is from Almighty Allah SWT. WitrQuran is simply a tool created to make listening easier for everyone by His will.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
